<title>JAPAN: Key 182nd 10-yr JGB yield rises 0.1 to 2.520 pct.</title>
<headline>Key 182nd 10-yr JGB yield rises 0.1 to 2.520 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The yield of the benchmark cash 182nd 10-year Japanese government bond (JGB) rose 0.1 percentage point to 2.520 percent in early Tokyo trade on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Key June JGB futures were also down sharply, falling as low as 123.68 in early trade, from Tuesday's close of 124.42.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-9780</p>
</text>
